Third-party notices

- The medium round textures (assets/cbcparts/textures/item/medium) are drawn
  by this mod's tools/draw_medium_textures.py; the item models only name CBC Neo
  Warfare's round and cartridge models and its cartridge texture, which are not
  included.
- src/generated/addon_fixes holds block loot tables, tags and recipes of
  CBC: Advanced Technologies and CBC Neo Warfare moved to the paths Minecraft
  1.21 reads, so the addons' own blocks drop and their data loads. That data
  belongs to the authors of those addons and is under their licenses
  (CBC: Advanced Technologies: All Rights Reserved; CBC Neo Warfare: MIT and
  CC BY-NC-SA). It refers only to the addons' own blocks and items and is only
  loaded when the addon is installed.
- tools/medium_shells holds munition property values of Create Big Cannons,
  CBC Enchanced Shells and CBC Neo Warfare shells, from which the medium round
  values are computed. They are not part of the built mod.
- Create Big Cannons, its addons and Create are not included and keep their
  own licenses.
